OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers. Sunshine turning
OL,7,Fhazier later in the afternoon with
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain arriving from the
OL,9,Fwest by the evening. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average and winds falling
OL,11,Flighter.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud thickens and lowers
OL,14,Ffrom the west with outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Ffollowing, locally heavy through the
OL,16,Fearly hours. Turning breezy and
OL,17,Fremaining mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
