OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly rain clears to the
OL,6,Feast to leave another day of sunny
OL,7,Fspells and scattered, locally heavy
OL,8,Fand blustery, showers. Breezy for all.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFurther
OL,11,Fwet weather arriving by the afternoon
OL,12,Fon Friday. Drier on Saturday and
OL,13,FSunday but blustery westerly winds and
OL,14,Fthe odd shower at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
